      "dct:title": "odrl-carrier",
      "dct:description": "The mapping onto an ODRL policy carried in sc:usageInfo, which Croissant 1.1 names as the place for fine-grained use conditions. Decision-equivalent to the cpol: carrier; see tests/test_carrier_equivalence.py.",
